# T-3051 — Notify-sidecar liveness canary (arc-003 deterministic wake rail)
# Source of truth: /opt/termlink/.context/cron/notify-sidecar-canary.crontab (git-tracked)
# Installed to:    /etc/cron.d/termlink-notify-sidecar-canary (USER field syntax — do NOT load into a user crontab)
#
# T-3049 measured the wake rail dark for 82 days and nothing noticed. The other
# canaries all ask whether the FLEET is well — hubs, binaries, wakers, claims,
# queues, topics, receipts. None asks whether THIS host can still hear, so an
# agent with dead ears looked healthy to every one of them.
#
# DISTINCT FROM THE SUPERVISOR (T-3050), which is a fixer, not detection. The
# supervisor can fail silently: a sidecar that crash-loops is restarted and dies
# every cycle, a start that fails every 5 minutes looks identical to one that
# never runs, and if the supervisor's own crontab was never installed it does
# nothing. This canary reads HEARTBEATS ONLY and never consults the supervisor,
# so it still fires in all three cases. A canary satisfied by its fixer's
# existence detects nothing.
#
# Scoped to agents DECLARED in notify-sidecar-agents.conf. ~/.termlink/notify/
# still holds July test residue whose heartbeats will never beat again; adopting
# every heartbeat found would make this permanently red, i.e. unread (T-2818).
#
# Threshold 300s = the supervisor's own cadence, so anything it CAN fix is fixed
# before this fires. What survives is what it could not fix. Empty log = healthy.
# /canaries auto-discovers this log.
#
# Operator action on firing: DEAD means the listener stopped and the supervisor
# could not revive it — read .context/working/notify-sidecar-<agent>.log first.
# MISSING means it has never run here — check `bash scripts/check-cron-install-drift.sh`.
# Ad-hoc: bash scripts/check-notify-sidecar-freshness.sh
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin

# Daily at 07:53 UTC — offset from :13 mirror, :17 unconfirmed-delivery,
# :27 stuck-claims, :33 session-control, :37 substrate-smoke, :43 frozen-husk,
# :47 task-finalization.
53 7 * * * root cd /opt/termlink && bash scripts/check-notify-sidecar-freshness.sh --quiet >> .context/working/.notify-sidecar-canary.log 2>> .context/working/.notify-sidecar-canary.log.stderr
